Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.67,0:02:04.35,Sign_Basic,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(608,0)\bord0\shad0\c&HFE810B&\fn@Microsoft YaHei UI\fs76\b1\pos(941,93)}Nossa, {\c}eu estava tão enganado sobre {\c&HFE810B&}ela
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.33,0:01:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\fnComic sans ms\fs60\an2\bord2\blur2.5\shad0\}Yuudachi no ato no kumo no kirema mo\N{\c&HFF7F09&}Correndo atrás da linha reta
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.28,0:01:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\fnComic sans ms\fs60\an2\bord2\blur2.5\shad0\}chokusen mo oikakete\N{\c&HFF7F09&}entre as nuvens, após a chuva de verão...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.42,0:01:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\fnComic sans ms\fs60\an2\bord2\blur2.5\shad0\}Mitsuketa yo\N{\c&HFF7F09&}Eu te achei!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.86,0:01:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\fnComic sans ms\fs60\an2\bord2\blur2.5\shad0\}Kimi wo mitsuketa\N{\c&HFF7F09&}Eu encontrei você.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.27,0:02:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\fnComic sans ms\fs60\an2\bord2\blur2.5\shad0\}Minarenai biru no setake to\N{\c&HFF7F09&}A altura desses prédios estranhos,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.57,0:02:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\fnComic sans ms\fs60\an2\bord2\blur2.5\shad0\}kasunde iku aze michi\N{\c&HFF7F09&}e as estradas que vão sumindo na névoa...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.59,0:02:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\fnComic sans ms\fs60\an2\bord2\blur2.5\shad0\}Sora wa suna wo katteru da toka\N{\c&HFF7F09&}Dizem que o céu esconde a areia,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.02,0:02:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\fnComic sans ms\fs60\an2\bord2\blur2.5\shad0\}kono chikyuu wa ijiwaru da?\N{\c&HFF7F09&}ou a Terra só está sendo maldosa?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.26,0:02:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\fnComic sans ms\fs60\an2\bord2\blur2.5\shad0\}Pitagorasu no otoshimono ga\N{\c&HFF7F09&}O legado de Pitágoras
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.40,0:02:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\fnComic sans ms\fs60\an2\bord2\blur2.5\shad0\}katei wo muzukashiku shita yo ne\N{\c&HFF7F09&}deixou nosso caminho mais difícil, né?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.40,0:02:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\fnComic sans ms\fs60\an2\bord2\blur2.5\shad0\}Futatsu wo musubu ono kyori wa\N{\c&HFF7F09&}A distância que une dois pontos
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.20,0:02:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\fnComic sans ms\fs60\an2\bord2\blur2.5\shad0\}chijou yori fukuzatsu da\N{\c&HFF7F09&}é mais complexa do que parece aqui no chão.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.19,0:02:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\fnComic sans ms\fs60\an2\bord2\blur2.5\shad0\}Dou shiyou mo nai kodoku ga\N{\c&HFF7F09&}Uma solidão inevitável
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.54,0:02:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\fnComic sans ms\fs60\an2\bord2\blur2.5\shad0\}dou shiyou mo naku karete iku\N{\c&HFF7F09&}vai se esgotando sem pressa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.72,0:02:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\fnComic sans ms\fs60\an2\bord2\blur2.5\shad0\}Inori ni kaete, himawari ga saku\N{\c&HFF7F09&}Feito prece, os girassóis florescem.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.93,0:02:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\fnComic sans ms\fs60\an2\bord2\blur2.5\shad0\}Sou da yo!\N{\c&HFF7F09&}Isso mesmo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.06,0:02:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\fnComic sans ms\fs60\an2\bord2\blur2.5\shad0\}Kawari hajimeta kokoro wo nazori, nazori, kasane nagara\N{\c&HFF7F09&}Traçando e revivendo este coração que muda,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.86,0:02:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\fnComic sans ms\fs60\an2\bord2\blur2.5\shad0\}fumidashite iku asufaruto ni\N{\c&HFF7F09&}sigo em frente pelo asfalto.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.70,0:02:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\fnComic sans ms\fs60\an2\bord2\blur2.5\shad0\}Riyuu wo tsukeru made no nanhyaku mairu\N{\c&HFF7F09&}São centenas de milhas até achar uma razão.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.96,0:02:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\fnComic sans ms\fs60\an2\bord2\blur2.5\shad0\}Machi no hikari ya attakai kaze mo\N{\c&HFF7F09&}As luzes da cidade e o vento morno
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.75,0:02:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\fnComic sans ms\fs60\an2\bord2\blur2.5\shad0\}ou furikaeru you ni\N{\c&HFF7F09&}parecem olhar para trás, nos seguindo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.65,0:02:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\fnComic sans ms\fs60\an2\bord2\blur2.5\shad0\}Fumei nara, yubisaki no ondo de\N{\c&HFF7F09&}Se tudo estiver incerto, guie-se pelo calor dos dedos
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.48,0:02:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\fnComic sans ms\fs60\an2\bord2\blur2.5\shad0\}ashidori no rizumu de sa\N{\c&HFF7F09&}e pelo ritmo dos seus passos.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.48,0:02:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\fnComic sans ms\fs60\an2\bord2\blur2.5\shad0\}Tsukune yo\N{\c&HFF7F09&}Eu vou nos conectar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.83,0:03:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\fnComic sans ms\fs60\an2\bord2\blur2.5\shad0\}Chanto shiawase ni naru kara ne\N{\c&HFF7F09&}Com certeza seremos felizes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.77,0:03:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\fnComic sans ms\fs60\an2\bord2\blur2.5\shad0\}Aru natsu no koto\N{\c&HFF7F09&}Naquele verão,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.45,0:03:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\fnComic sans ms\fs60\an2\bord2\blur2.5\shad0\}himawari ga matsu\N{\c&HFF7F09&}os girassóis nos esperam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.05,0:03:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\fnComic sans ms\fs60\an2\bord2\blur2.5\shad0\}Ano keshiki ni chikau\N{\c&HFF7F09&}Eu prometo àquela paisagem!
